      "message": "I\u0027m not sure I agree with the analysis.\n  lru_reap_impl() -\u003e cih_remove_latched() -\u003e mdcache_lru_unref(SENTINAL).\n\nmdcache_lru_unref() only calls mdcache_lru_clean() if the refcount goes to 0.  However, lru_reap_impl() only calls cih_remove_latched() if the refcount is 2 (SENTINAL plus the one it holds).  So refcnt can\u0027t go to 0 in this case, and mdcache_lru_clean() will not be called.\n\nIt\u0027s been a while since I analyzed these callpaths, and I may have missed something.",
